OL,3,GNEWSAScot arrested in Thailand over
OL,4,Aalleged phone theft faces six-week
OL,5,Averdict wait
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Scottish backpacker who was arrested
OL,8,Fin Thailand after he was accused of
OL,9,Fstealing a mobile phone, faces a
OL,10,Fsix-week wait to find out if he will be
OL,11,Fallowed to return home.
OL,13,FRory McColl, from Edinburgh, claims he
OL,14,Fmistakenly picked up a woman's phone
OL,15,Ffrom a bar, thinking it was his own,
OL,16,Fjust hours after arriving in Bangkok in
OL,17,Fearly March.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
