OL,3,GNEWSAScot arrested in Thailand over
OL,4,Aalleged phone theft faces six-week
OL,5,Averdict wait
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis family told BBC Scotland News two
OL,8,FThai police officers testified that the
OL,9,Fincident was a "misunderstanding" and
OL,10,Fno-one else, including the alleged
OL,11,Fvictim, suggested otherwise during a
OL,12,Fhearing before four judges in the Thai
OL,13,Fcapital on Thursday.
OL,15,FA verdict in the case is due to be
OL,16,Fissued on 9 December.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
